Package: Jass
Title: Tools for playing the game of Jass
Version: 0.3
Authors@R: person("Randy", "Johnson", email = "johnson@hood.edu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package contains tools for playing a game of Jass with one or more AI players. A deep learning model with weights is included, as well as the tools used to train the model.
